---
description: Crop database and agronomy research rules
globs: data/crops/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Crop data lives in `data/crops/crops.csv`. Columns are defined in `data/crops/crops.template.csv`.
- Every row needs a `source_url` (university extension, FAO, or USDA). No source, no row.
- Kc values follow FAO-56 (initial, mid, late) with lengths of growth stages in days.
- Mark unknown values as empty, never guess. The tool displays unknowns as data gaps.
- Rotation templates: add a cover crop, add a legume, add a small grain, swap in a drought-tolerant crop, add a perennial forage phase.
